            "review_title": "Review at Golden Elephant Thai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sundncr\nWashington DC, District of Columbia1190 contributions\n1\nTasty Thai Food\nJul 2019 • Solo\nThis restaurant has got its basic Thai dishes right. It is located near the Sheraton hotel in District 1. A small restaurant with a few white clothed tables. The staff promptly seated me and took my orders. I ordered fried breaded prawns and Thai curry with potatoes and yellow curry seasonings and rice. It was a good dish tasty dish. Price wise not too expensive\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2019",
